# Complete tracked Aureon organism for the public Space image.
# The publisher stages exact Git blobs, so tests, research, data, documents,
# historical source copies, and every other tracked path stay in the context.
# Keep only credential/VCS defenses; never use relevance-based source filters.
.git
.git/**
**/.git
**/.git/**
**/.env
**/.env.*
!.env.example
!**/.env.example
**/credentials.json
**/secrets.json
**/secrets.yaml
**/secrets.yml
**/id_dsa
**/id_ecdsa
**/id_ed25519
**/id_rsa
**/*.jks
**/*.key
**/*.keystore
**/*.p12
**/*.pem
**/*.pfx
